      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "あたくしは紅茶を好んで嗜みますの。\n我が心を射止めたいのなら、まずは\n極上の紅茶をお持ちになって。\n望むのは「緋灼の雫」という稀有な茶葉です。",
        "official_en": "I take great pleasure in a soothing cup of tea.\nShould you wish to win my heart, you must bring\nme the finest tea—a rare brew known as scarlet\nfiredrops!",
        "real_en": null
      },
